{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26958","headline":"和李舍人秋日卧疾言怀 · 姚合","name":"和李舍人秋日卧疾言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲卧襟情远，西风菊渐芳。\n虚窗通晓景，珍簟卷秋光。\n果坠青莎径，尘离绿藓墙。\n药匳开静室，书阁出丛篁。\n对酒吟难尽，思山梦稍长。\n王言生彩笔，朝服惹炉香。\n松影幽连砌，虫声冷到牀。\n诗成谁敢和，清思若怀霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}